@startuml layers
title apps/starchess — import layers (enforced by .dependency-cruiser.cjs)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "routes" {
  [screens] as screens
  [demos] as demos
}
package "app side" {
  [app] as app
  [tutorial] as tutorial
  [achievements] as ach
}
package "presentation" {
  [animations] as anim
  [pieces] as pieces
  [board / combat / hud / specials / timeline] as pres
}
package "components" {
  [features] as features
  [atoms] as atoms
  [primitives] as prims
}
[store (UI-wide flags)] as store
[hooks] as hooks
[adapters] as adapters
[types] as types

screens --> demos
screens --> app
demos --> app
app --> pres
app --> components
pres --> anim
anim --> pieces
pres --> components
features --> atoms
atoms --> prims
pres --> store
components --> store
app --> adapters
pres --> adapters

pieces -[#red,dashed]-> anim : pieces-below-animations
prims -[#red,dashed]-> pres : primitives-stay-presentational\n(known: PromotionModal → PieceGlyph)
atoms -[#red,dashed]-> features : atoms-below-features
components -[#red,dashed]-> screens : components-below-routes
pres -[#red,dashed]-> app : presentation-below-app\n(known: 6 edges)
store -[#red,dashed]-> pres : store-below-ui
types -[#red,dashed]-> app : types-are-leaves

note right of pres
  Known violations (baseline, 7 in
  .dependency-cruiser-known-violations.json;
  30 → 15 → 7: the store context moved to
  ~/ports/matchStore; specials and hud read
  store.view; the storeless ResourceBar rules
  gasRemainingFor / estimateStoredFromSnap moved
  to starchess-core rules/economy):
  • board (LiveStarChessBoard, useBoardInput),
    combat (useIntentOverlays) → selectors,
    intentOverlayPolicy, achievementLive
  • PromotionModal (primitive) → PieceGlyph
  Paying one off: add the read to MatchView
  (store.view, ~/types/match) — or, when it needs
  no store, to starchess-core — call it from
  presentation, then run check:deps:baseline
  (shrink-only) so the baseline shrinks.
end note

note bottom
  pnpm lint runs oxlint, then check:deps (--ignore-known): a new violation fails,
  a paid-off one goes stale — check:deps:baseline drops it (shrink-only).
  Type-only imports are exempt everywhere (they vanish at runtime);
  cycles are judged on runtime edges only.
  timers-through-adapter: only adapters/ and MatchStoreContext import adapters/browser.
end note
@enduml
